{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":387977,\"title\":\"Lulù\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A monkey comes home and uses a magic wand to make himself dinner. No sooner as he falls asleep, a hungry burglar enters his house. This short film was made by Segundo de Chomón in 1923 in his private studio with the help of his wife and son, outside of any studio structure, and has never had a regular distribution.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nojlhHbO4nZPkl51LGFNesgrJO7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1923,\"runtime\":8,\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Segundo de Chomón\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":41616,\"name\":\"Segundo de Chomón\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3iCsGlo1XUbvy61411fMHb8bZdP.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":803796,\"title\":\"KPop Demon Hunters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren't selling out stadiums, they're using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":360920,\"title\":\"The Grinch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Al7DMUp8bqUN4JwXVNxfJYyv5cH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lWIYxYEqWi8j3ZloxXntw3ImBo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Grinch hatches a scheme to ruin Christmas when the residents of Whoville plan their annual holiday celebration. But a certain little who might change things.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1185806,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxXSF4aY5N2cOGwaga5OnpPFHzk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY4LyVSvjk9dN20YsxuouaMIMox.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a storm, where they meet Rex, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless mining triggers a volcano, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet to save the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2062,\"title\":\"Ratatouille\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t3vaWRPSf6WjDSamIkKDs1iQWna.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zeoaHdXRDd5IoUiMVsNhwTZm78B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In one of Paris's finest restaurants, Remy, a determined young rat, dreams of becoming a renowned French chef. Torn between his family's wishes and his true calling, Remy and his pal Linguini set in motion a hilarious chain of events that turns the City of Lights upside down.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":585,\"title\":\"Monsters, Inc.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7VbRPlev1bRfKvTxr98erw5T7B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis. When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it's the monsters who are scared silly, and it's up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315162,\"title\":\"Puss in Boots: The Last Wish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kuf6dutpsT0vSVehic3EZIqkOBt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jr8tSoJGj33XLgFBy6lmZhpGQNu.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1241982,\"title\":\"Moana 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLVkiINlIeCkcZIzb7XHzPYgO6L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vYqt6kb4lcF8wwqsMMaULkP9OEn.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana journeys alongside Maui and a new crew to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she's ever faced.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40619,\"title\":\"Day & Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hn2tOtidoYZ0D56jR4yknpdP1mU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i05QKKn8GqAdmQSeAztxhuqN6dt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Day, a sunny fellow, encounters Night, a stranger of distinctly darker moods, sparks fly! Day and Night are frightened and suspicious of each other at first, and quickly get off on the wrong foot. But as they discover each other's unique qualities--and come to realize that each of them offers a different window onto the same world-the friendship helps both to gain a new perspective.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"kk0jqZMFtoI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nhM2tAszd2s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qt0TdX1uJcc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}